 tags HEAD as a release and pushes the tag, after the rules a release keeps

   <version>  the version to release: 0.1.0, or 0.1.0-rc.7 for a pre-release

   --lower    confirms a version that is not higher than the highest release on origin, such as a
              fix to an older line; kit asks nothing itself, so the confirmation is this flag


 kit release
